WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.233
Okay!

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:11.433
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:12.067
A.

00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:12.733
Monday,

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:13.367
B.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:14.000
Tuesday,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.633
C.

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:15.267
March,

00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:16.567
or D.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:17.200
Friday?

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.467
Five seconds!

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:25.467
TIME'S UP!

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:27.300
The answer is...

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:27.700
C,

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.100
march!

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.500
Monday,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:28.900
Tuesday,

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.233
and Friday are all days of

00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:32.033
the week.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.600
March is a month,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.567
so it does not belong.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:37.133
So,

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:39.167
are you smart or fart?

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:41.600
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:42.800
find your rank!

00:00:43.967 --> 00:00:44.300
So,

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.700
how did you do?

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.067
Comment your score below,

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.433
and follow for more!
